  "description": "All her friends do is talk about sex! But Yuna the virgin’s very single, and she has a plan to score some action. When she meets a cuddly teddy bear mascot (real name: Minseok), she does what any sane(?) girl would do: stalk him at the bar where he works and proposition him for a one-night stand. It was very enjoyable~ but he’s not sticking around. It's too bad though since they’re actually in the same major at school. Will this be an awkward city or are they destined for some more serious playtime? \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes the prologue.*",
